                                                "sense_id": "2366284e-5a9d-3ea4-a591-445cde8c181b",
                                                "text": "Yet his Lordship would find this rate of proportion […] likewise in all plants, in the disposition of their leaves, for which ordering he would make a name, that is, from the Greek, phyllotaxis."
                                            }
                                        ]
